84		// allocation: a corrupt/malformed header could otherwise request a giant
85		// vocab map / scales / matrix (or overflow vocabSize*dim) before take()
86		// discovers the truncation, defeating the graceful degrade-to-lexical path.
87		// The file is an upper bound on every section, and dividing avoids computing
